  ],
  "notes": "School starts in the year a child turns 7; the year of pre-primary education (esiopetus) before it is compulsory but excluded. Grades 1–6 are commonly called alakoulu and 7–9 yläkoulu. Lukio is course-based (150 credits) and usually takes three years; vocational upper secondary is a separate route. Swedish-language schools use årskurs 1–9."
